/**
 * Advance widths for the poster typeface, measured rather than estimated.
 *
 * Generated by scripts/calibrate-widths.ts, which rasterises one copy and
 * eleven copies of each glyph and divides the difference by ten — side
 * bearings cancel, leaving the true advance. Regenerate this file whenever the
 * poster typeface changes; a stale table means names collide on a printed
 * poster, which is the one defect a customer cannot forgive.
 */

